{"id":"r4ohu0lib6kbjsgedm9ckwho7","title":"SpaceX星舰首次尝试双回收，上海发布卫星互联网产业方案","originalTitle":"星舰首次挑战双回收！卫星板块冲击六连阳","summary":"SpaceX星舰第15次试飞定于11月14日，首次尝试同时回收飞船与助推器。上海发布《卫星互联网产业创新发展行动方案》，目标2030年卫星超3000颗、产业规模破800亿。招商基金卫星ETF（159218）覆盖卫星制造、地面设备等环节，券商认为当前产业链进入价值重估阶段。","reason":"SpaceX星舰双回收试飞或降低发射成本，上海政策推动卫星互联网产业链发展","source":{"name":"界面新闻"},"links":{"original":"https://www.jiemian.com/article/15319065.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T01:52:18.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-11T02:16:41.141Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-11T02:16:41.141Z","category":"crypto-market","tags":["行情异动","研究报告"],"score":85,"selected":true,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":"jianli@jiemian.com(有连云)","body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[{"slug":"crypto-market","name":"行情异动"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":true,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}